  ('PHIL 311', 'Metaphysics II', 'University of Nigeria, Nsukka', 'Faculty of Social Sciences', 'Philosophy', '300 Level', 'first', 2, 'This studies the Metaphysical concept of nature, society and thought; positivists'' view; metaphysics and other Discipline, specific authors. The relevance of metaphysics to contemporary problems.', '["This studies the Metaphysical concept of nature, society and thought; positivists'' view", "Metaphysics and other Discipline, specific authors", "The relevance of metaphysics to contemporary problems"]'::jsonb, 'Department of Philosophy handbook'),
